<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="secrets"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="OneRepublic"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445840797"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我需要一个新的故事</text><text for="L2">一些能一吐为快的心事</text><text for="L3">生活渐渐变得有些枯燥</text><text for="L4">渴望有能彻底坦白的秘密</text><text for="L5">直到我的双袖尽染鲜红</text><text for="L6">全因我道尽了所有真言</text><text for="L7">这一切问心无愧 我发誓</text><text for="L8">以为我只是眨眼戏谑 绝不是</text><text for="L9">我一直濒临崩溃边缘 所以</text><text for="L10">告诉我你想听到什么</text><text for="L11">那些能点亮你双耳的旋律</text><text for="L12">谁也受够了这世间的虚情假意？</text><text for="L13">所以我要将心底的秘密全盘托出</text><text for="L14">这一次 不需要又一个完美的谎言</text><text for="L15">不在乎乐评人是否排队苛评</text><text for="L16">我要毫无保留地交出所有秘密</text><text for="L17">天呐 真不可思议我们能走到今天</text><text for="L18">就像我们一直在追赶那些耀眼巨星</text><text for="L19">那些开着锃亮气派黑色豪车的人</text><text for="L20">每一天 看着新闻里的播报</text><text for="L21">那些我们本能够解决的难题</text><text for="L22">可每当现实出现风波</text><text for="L23">便干脆写进一张专辑</text><text for="L24">直接让它冲上金唱片</text><text for="L25">但我真的不喜欢自己的这套套路 绝不 所以</text><text for="L26">告诉我你想听到什么</text><text for="L27">那些能让你耳目一新的动听旋律</text><text for="L28">还有谁厌倦了这些虚伪造作？</text><text for="L29">所以我要毫无保留地交出所有秘密</text><text for="L30">这一次 不需要又一个完美的谎言</text><text for="L31">不在乎乐评人是否排队苛评</text><text for="L32">我要把心底所有的秘密全盘托出</text><text for="L33">噢 毫无借口 毫无愧疚</text><text for="L34">也没有任何家人可以推脱怪罪</text><text for="L35">只要别任由我消逝无踪</text><text for="L36">我会对你倾吐一切</text><text for="L37">那就告诉我你想听到什么</text><text for="L38">那些能点亮你双耳的动人歌声</text><text for="L39">谁也受够了这世间的虚情假意？</text><text for="L40">所以我要将心底的秘密全盘托出</text><text for="L41">这一次 不需要又一个完美的谎言</text><text for="L42">不在乎苛评是否排起长队</text><text for="L43">我要彻底坦白所有秘密</text><text for="L44">那就告诉我你想听到什么</text><text for="L45">那些能让你双耳为之一振的旋律</text><text for="L46">还有谁受够了这些虚伪造作？</text><text for="L47">所以我要毫无保留地交出所有秘密</text><text for="L48">这一次 不需要又一个完美的谎言</text><text for="L49">哪怕评论家们排队指责我也无所谓</text><text for="L50">我要将我所有的秘密全盘托出</text><text for="L51">彻底交出心底所有秘密</text><text for="L52">将一切秘密全盘托出</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:41.255"><div begin="0:12.083" end="3:41.255"><p begin="0:12.083" end="0:14.293" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.083" end="0:12.203">I</span> <span begin="0:12.203" end="0:12.503">need</span> <span begin="0:12.503" end="0:12.573">an</span><span begin="0:12.573" end="0:12.883">oth</span><span begin="0:12.883" end="0:12.993">er</span> <span begin="0:12.993" end="0:13.563">sto</span><span begin="0:13.563" end="0:14.293">ry</span></p><p begin="0:15.333" end="0:18.183" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.333" end="0:15.673">Some</span><span begin="0:15.673" end="0:15.873">thing</span> <span begin="0:15.873" end="0:16.093">to</span> <span begin="0:16.093" end="0:16.383">get</span> <span begin="0:16.383" end="0:16.733">off</span> <span begin="0:16.733" end="0:17.073">my</span> <span begin="0:17.073" end="0:18.183">chest</span></p><p begin="0:18.484" end="0:20.824" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.484" end="0:18.674">My</span> <span begin="0:18.674" end="0:18.894">life</span> <span begin="0:18.894" end="0:19.084">gets</span> <span begin="0:19.084" end="0:19.364">kind</span> <span begin="0:19.364" end="0:19.504">of</span> <span begin="0:19.504" end="0:19.964">bor</span><span begin="0:19.964" end="0:20.824">ing</span></p><p begin="0:21.721" end="0:24.381" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.721" end="0:21.891">Need</span> <span begin="0:21.891" end="0:22.131">some</span><span begin="0:22.131" end="0:22.391">thing</span> <span begin="0:22.391" end="0:22.611">that</span> <span begin="0:22.611" end="0:22.741">I</span> <span begin="0:22.741" end="0:23.171">can</span> <span begin="0:23.171" end="0:23.511">con</span><span begin="0:23.511" end="0:24.381">fess</span></p><p begin="0:25.354" end="0:28.364" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.354" end="0:25.634">'Til</span> <span begin="0:25.634" end="0:25.754">all</span> <span begin="0:25.754" end="0:25.944">my</span> <span begin="0:25.944" end="0:26.514">sleeves</span> <span begin="0:26.514" end="0:26.724">are</span> <span begin="0:26.724" end="0:27.314">stained</span> <span begin="0:27.314" end="0:28.364">red</span></p><p begin="0:28.610" end="0:31.620" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.610" end="0:28.950">From</span> <span begin="0:28.950" end="0:29.110">all</span> <span begin="0:29.110" end="0:29.240">the</span> <span begin="0:29.240" end="0:29.730">truth</span> <span begin="0:29.730" end="0:30.150">that</span> <span begin="0:30.150" end="0:30.420">I've</span> <span begin="0:30.420" end="0:31.620">said</span></p><p begin="0:31.867" end="0:34.757" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.867" end="0:32.117">Come</span> <span begin="0:32.117" end="0:32.357">by</span> <span begin="0:32.357" end="0:32.567">it</span> <span begin="0:32.567" end="0:32.907">hon</span><span begin="0:32.907" end="0:33.307">est</span><span begin="0:33.307" end="0:33.757">ly,</span> <span begin="0:33.757" end="0:33.927">I</span> <span begin="0:33.927" end="0:34.757">swear</span></p><p begin="0:34.899" end="0:36.429" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.899" end="0:35.169">Thought</span> <span begin="0:35.169" end="0:35.289">you</span> <span begin="0:35.289" end="0:35.549">saw</span> <span begin="0:35.549" end="0:35.789">me</span> <span begin="0:35.789" end="0:36.159">wink,</span> <span begin="0:36.159" end="0:36.429">no</span></p><p begin="0:36.610" end="0:38.050" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.610" end="0:36.770">I've</span> <span begin="0:36.770" end="0:37.040">been</span> <span begin="0:37.040" end="0:37.250">on</span> <span begin="0:37.250" end="0:37.390">the</span> <span begin="0:37.390" end="0:37.700">brink,</span> <span begin="0:37.700" end="0:38.050">so</span></p><p begin="0:38.057" end="0:41.137" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.057" end="0:38.367">Tell</span> <span begin="0:38.367" end="0:38.557">me</span> <span begin="0:38.557" end="0:38.797">what</span> <span begin="0:38.797" end="0:39.017">you</span> <span begin="0:39.017" end="0:39.367">want</span> <span begin="0:39.367" end="0:39.727">to</span> <span begin="0:39.727" end="0:41.137">hear</span></p><p begin="0:41.359" end="0:44.319" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.359" end="0:41.609">Some</span><span begin="0:41.609" end="0:41.859">thing</span> <span begin="0:41.859" end="0:42.259">that'll</span> <span begin="0:42.259" end="0:42.579">light</span> <span begin="0:42.579" end="0:43.129">those</span> <span begin="0:43.129" end="0:44.319">ears</span></p><p begin="0:44.455" end="0:47.255" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.455" end="0:44.615">Who's</span> <span begin="0:44.615" end="0:44.905">sick</span> <span begin="0:44.905" end="0:45.095">of</span> <span begin="0:45.095" end="0:45.265">all</span> <span begin="0:45.265" end="0:45.525">the</span> <span begin="0:45.525" end="0:45.755">in</span><span begin="0:45.755" end="0:46.135">sin</span><span begin="0:46.135" end="0:47.255">cere?</span></p><p begin="0:47.264" end="0:52.274" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.264" end="0:47.474">So</span> <span begin="0:47.564" end="0:47.924">I'm</span> <span begin="0:47.924" end="0:48.314">gonna</span> <span begin="0:48.314" end="0:48.584">give</span> <span begin="0:48.784" end="0:49.514">all</span> <span begin="0:49.514" end="0:50.204">my</span> <span begin="0:50.204" end="0:50.784">se</span><span begin="0:50.784" end="0:51.194">crets</span> <span begin="0:51.194" end="0:52.274">away</span></p><p begin="0:52.276" end="0:56.866" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.276" end="0:52.716">This</span> <span begin="0:52.716" end="0:53.966">time,</span> <span begin="0:54.176" end="0:54.436">don't</span> <span begin="0:54.436" end="0:54.626">need</span> <span begin="0:54.626" end="0:54.686">an</span><span begin="0:54.686" end="0:54.996">oth</span><span begin="0:54.996" end="0:55.126">er</span> <span begin="0:55.126" end="0:55.476">per</span><span begin="0:55.476" end="0:55.876">fect</span> <span begin="0:55.876" end="0:56.866">lie</span></p><p begin="0:56.843" end="1:00.243" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.843" end="0:57.243">Don't</span> <span begin="0:57.243" end="0:57.453">care</span> <span begin="0:57.453" end="0:57.603">if</span> <span begin="0:57.603" end="0:57.853">crit</span><span begin="0:57.853" end="0:58.083">ics</span> <span begin="0:58.083" end="0:58.243">ev</span><span begin="0:58.243" end="0:58.353">er</span> <span begin="0:58.353" end="0:58.903">jump</span> <span begin="0:58.903" end="0:59.193">in</span> <span begin="0:59.193" end="1:00.243">line</span></p><p begin="1:00.555" end="1:05.015" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.555" end="1:00.875">I'm</span> <span begin="1:00.875" end="1:01.275">gonna</span> <span begin="1:01.275" end="1:01.555">give</span> <span begin="1:01.725" end="1:02.465">all</span> <span begin="1:02.465" end="1:03.195">my</span> <span begin="1:03.195" end="1:03.725">se</span><span begin="1:03.725" end="1:04.165">crets</span> <span begin="1:04.165" end="1:05.015">away</span></p><p begin="1:05.289" end="1:10.029" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.289" end="1:05.619">My</span> <span begin="1:05.619" end="1:06.749">God,</span> <span begin="1:07.189" end="1:07.779">amazing</span> <span begin="1:07.779" end="1:07.959">that</span> <span begin="1:07.959" end="1:08.109">we</span> <span begin="1:08.109" end="1:08.529">got</span> <span begin="1:08.529" end="1:08.929">this</span> <span begin="1:08.929" end="1:10.029">far</span></p><p begin="1:10.439" end="1:13.189" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.439" end="1:10.659">It's</span> <span begin="1:10.659" end="1:10.859">like</span> <span begin="1:10.859" end="1:10.959">we're</span> <span begin="1:10.959" end="1:11.209">chas</span><span begin="1:11.209" end="1:11.519">ing</span> <span begin="1:11.519" end="1:11.759">all</span> <span begin="1:11.759" end="1:12.139">those</span> <span begin="1:12.139" end="1:13.189">stars</span></p><p begin="1:13.661" end="1:16.521" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.661" end="1:13.831">Who's</span> <span begin="1:13.831" end="1:14.041">driv</span><span begin="1:14.041" end="1:14.181">ing</span> <span begin="1:14.181" end="1:14.621">shiny</span> <span begin="1:14.621" end="1:14.981">big</span> <span begin="1:14.981" end="1:15.431">black</span> <span begin="1:15.431" end="1:16.521">cars</span></p><p begin="1:17.324" end="1:18.994" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.324" end="1:17.574">And</span> <span begin="1:17.574" end="1:17.734">ev</span><span begin="1:17.734" end="1:17.834">ery</span><span begin="1:17.834" end="1:18.134">day,</span> <span begin="1:18.134" end="1:18.254">I</span> <span begin="1:18.254" end="1:18.524">see</span> <span begin="1:18.524" end="1:18.614">the</span> <span begin="1:18.614" end="1:18.994">news</span></p><p begin="1:18.996" end="1:20.626" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.996" end="1:19.166">All</span> <span begin="1:19.166" end="1:19.236">the</span> <span begin="1:19.236" end="1:19.616">prob</span><span begin="1:19.616" end="1:19.756">lems</span> <span begin="1:19.756" end="1:19.946">that</span> <span begin="1:19.946" end="1:20.106">we</span> <span begin="1:20.106" end="1:20.276">could</span> <span begin="1:20.276" end="1:20.626">solve</span></p><p begin="1:20.623" end="1:22.413" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">